 style with checkpatch script
Date: Thu, 28 Aug 2014 18:02:36 +0900
Message-ID: <1409216559-22402-3-git-send-email-cw00.choi@samsung.com>
References: <1409216559-22402-1-git-send-email-cw00.choi@samsung.com>
